<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-about-accent py-16 text-on-about-accent sm:py-20 lg:py-24"
  aria-labelledby="objetivos-title"
>
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_rgba(255,255,255,0.09),_transparent_60%)]"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 [background-image:radial-gradient(circle_at_1px_1px,_white_1px,_transparent_0)] [background-size:24px_24px] opacity-[0.035]"
  >
  </div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1280px] px-6 lg:px-8">
    <header class="max-w-3xl">
      <p
        class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-on-about-accent/70 uppercase"
      >
        Objetivos — Cómo lo haremos
      </p>
      <h2
        id="objetivos-title"
        class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl"
      >
        Objetivos Estratégicos
      </h2>
      <p
        class="mt-3 max-w-2xl font-body text-sm leading-6 text-on-about-accent/75"
      >
        Seis compromisos que articulan nuestra red, sostienen la calidad y ponen
        a las personas en el centro de cada decisión.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ul
      class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:auto-rows-[minmax(220px,auto)] lg:grid-cols-12"
      role="list"
    >
      <li
        class="relative flex overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-white/15 bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(24,24,27,0.08)] sm:p-8 lg:col-span-8 lg:min-h-[320px]"
      >
        <article
          aria-labelledby="objetivo-1-title"
          class="relative flex w-full flex-col"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-about-primary text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-on-about-primary"
              >01</span
            >
            <p
              class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-on-about-secondary/60 uppercase"
            >
              Centrar — Red integrada
            </p>
          </div>
          <h3
            id="objetivo-1-title"
            class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-on-about-secondary sm:text-2xl"
          >
            Personas en el centro
          </h3>
          <p
            class="mt-3 font-body text-[15px] leading-6 text-on-about-secondary/70"
          >
            Poner a las personas en el centro del sistema de salud, articulando
            una red de servicios integrada que garantice una atención cercana,
            oportuna y de calidad.
          </p>
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 size-24 rounded-full bg-about-accent/10 blur-2xl"
          >
          </div>
        </article>
      </li>

      <li
        class="relative flex overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-white/15 bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(24,24,27,0.08)] sm:p-8 lg:col-span-4 lg:min-h-[320px]"
      >
        <article
          aria-labelledby="objetivo-2-title"
          class="relative flex w-full flex-col"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-about-secondary text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-on-about-secondary"
              >02</span
            >
            <p
              class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-on-about-secondary/60 uppercase"
            >
              Prevenir
            </p>
          </div>
          <h3
            id="objetivo-2-title"
            class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-on-about-secondary"
          >
            Prevención y cuidado
          </h3>
          <p
            class="mt-3 font-body text-[15px] leading-6 text-on-about-secondary/70"
          >
            Promover la prevención y el cuidado de la salud, identificando y
            gestionando oportunamente los riesgos que puedan afectar el
            bienestar de nuestros afiliados.
          </p>
        </article>
      </li>

      <li
        class="relative flex overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-white/15 bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(24,24,27,0.08)] sm:p-8 lg:col-span-5 lg:min-h-[260px]"
      >
        <article
          aria-labelledby="objetivo-3-title"
          class="relative flex w-full flex-col"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-on-about-secondary/15 bg-white text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-on-about-secondary"
              >03</span
            >
            <p
              class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-on-about-secondary/60 uppercase"
            >
              Asegurar
            </p>
          </div>
          <h3
            id="objetivo-3-title"
            class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-on-about-secondary"
          >
            Atención segura
          </h3>
          <p
            class="mt-3 font-body text-[15px] leading-6 text-on-about-secondary/70"
          >
            Garantizar una atención segura y de calidad, reduciendo eventos
            evitables y fortaleciendo continuamente los procesos y servicios
            ofrecidos por Kenko EPS.
          </p>
        </article>
      </li>

      <li
        class="relative flex overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-white/15 bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(24,24,27,0.08)] sm:p-8 lg:col-span-3 lg:min-h-[260px]"
      >
        <article
          aria-labelledby="objetivo-4-title"
          class="relative flex w-full flex-col"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-on-about-secondary text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-white"
              >04</span
            >
            <p
              class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-on-about-secondary/60 uppercase"
            >
              Gestionar
            </p>
          </div>
          <h3
            id="objetivo-4-title"
            class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-on-about-secondary"
          >
            Recursos responsables
          </h3>
          <p
            class="mt-3 font-body text-[15px] leading-6 text-on-about-secondary/70"
          >
            Gestionar responsablemente los recursos, buscando un equilibrio
            entre la sostenibilidad financiera y la prestación de servicios de
            calidad.
          </p>
        </article>
      </li>

      <li
        class="relative flex overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-white/15 bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(24,24,27,0.08)] sm:p-8 lg:col-span-4 lg:min-h-[260px]"
      >
        <article
          aria-labelledby="objetivo-5-title"
          class="relative flex w-full flex-col"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-about-accent text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-on-about-accent"
              >05</span
            >
            <p
              class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-on-about-secondary/60 uppercase"
            >
              Innovar
            </p>
          </div>
          <h3
            id="objetivo-5-title"
            class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-on-about-secondary"
          >
            Organización futura
          </h3>
          <p
            class="mt-3 font-body text-[15px] leading-6 text-on-about-secondary/70"
          >
            Construir una organización preparada para el futuro, fortaleciendo
            la innovación, la tecnología y la capacidad de adaptación frente a
            los cambios del sector salud.
          </p>
        </article>
      </li>

      <li
        class="relative flex overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-white/15 bg-white p-7 shadow-[0_12px_36px_rgba(24,24,27,0.10)] sm:p-8 lg:col-span-12 lg:min-h-[220px]"
      >
        <article
          aria-labelledby="objetivo-6-title"
          class="relative flex w-full flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:gap-10"
        >
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-about-primary text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest text-on-about-primary"
                >06</span
              >
              <p
                class="font-body text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-on-about-secondary/60 uppercase"
              >
                Confiar — Experiencia humana
              </p>
            </div>
            <h3
              id="objetivo-6-title"
              class="mt-4 font-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-on-about-secondary sm:text-2xl"
            >
              Confianza humana
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p
            class="mt-4 max-w-2xl flex-1 font-body text-[15px] leading-6 text-on-about-secondary/70 lg:mt-0"
          >
            Fortalecer la confianza de nuestros afiliados, creando experiencias
            de atención más humanas, transparentes y cercanas que permitan que
            cada persona se sienta escuchada y acompañada.
          </p>
          <div
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 -right-10 hidden size-40 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-about-secondary/20 blur-3xl lg:block"
          >
          </div>
        </article>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
